  <title>W01 Quiz: WhatsApp </title>
  <description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;: Get set up with the group you will be working with throughout the course.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Task&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Set up WhatsApp, join your WhatsApp group, and introduce yourself to your group in WhatsApp, and provide your instructor your WhatsApp phone number.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You will be put into two WhatsApp groups. One group is for the instructor to communicate with the class to post announcements. The other group is for you to work with your classmates on assignments. Remember, these groups and the information in these groups (including WhatsApp contact information) is to be used&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;"&gt;for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;"&gt;only&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;class purposes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Conditions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Download WhatsApp (if you do not already have it downloaded).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Additional resources to help download the app from the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="external" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/whatsapp-messenger/id310633997" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Apple App Store,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="external" href="https://www.whatsapp.com/android/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Android Download page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="external" href="https://www.whatsapp.com/download/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span&gt;PC and MAC Desktop Download page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="external_link_icon" role="presentation"&gt;&lt;span class="screenreader-only"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Use the link in the email from your instructor to join your WhatsApp group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In WhatsApp: P&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ost&lt;/strong&gt; "Hi" to your group in WhatsApp after joining your WhatsApp group&lt;strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;(You will only see comments after you post. You will see nothing before your post.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;If you need to report a WhatsApp Issue, please use this&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="external" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdyVuJRjdnYckoZyoYmhBVXJD36yFzfhdxQu875EQfZhM4dyQ/viewform" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span&gt;WhatsApp Help form.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;</description>
